{"content_hash": "c82c7ba2036c6241", "version_id": 182, "article_id": 19, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Arteta Becomes Premier League's Highest-Paid Manager", "title_zh": "阿尔特塔成为英超收入最高的主教练", "topic": "sports", "source": "skysports", "source_url": "https://www.skysports.com/football/news/12040/13596325/arsenal-manager-mikel-arteta-becomes-premier-leagues-highest-paid-boss-on-20m-a-year-new-contract-paper-talk", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://e2.365dm.com/26/08/1920x1080/skysports-paper-talk-football_7317647.jpg?20260809160824", "credit": ""}, "published_date": "2026-10-07", "word_count": 192, "reading_minutes": 1.0, "lead": "Mikel Arteta has signed a new contract with Arsenal. He will earn £20 million a year. This makes him the highest-paid manager in the Premier League.", "lead_zh": "米克尔·阿尔特塔与阿森纳签下新合同。他每年将赚2000万英镑。这让他成为英超收入最高的主教练。", "preview": "Mikel Arteta is the manager of Arsenal. He has signed a new contract. The new deal pays him £20 million a year. Now he is the highest-paid b", "preview_zh": "米克尔·阿尔特塔是阿森纳的主教练。他签下了一份新合同。新合同每年付给他2000万英镑。现在他是英超收入最高的主教练。这个消息来自《每日邮报》。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 171, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e099b16/content/audio/19/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 82.162, "size_bytes": 496656, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 223, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e099b16/content/data/versions/182.json", "paragraphs": ["Mikel Arteta is the manager of Arsenal. He has signed a new contract. The new deal pays him £20 million a year. Now he is the highest-paid boss in the Premier League. This news comes from the Daily Mail.", "Liverpool are also making news. They are thinking about signing another big player. They want to add to their strong attack. This story is from the Daily Star.", "In other news, Kieran McKenna has a new job. He now works for UEFA as a technical observer. This is just months after he left Ipswich. The Sun reported this.", "Thomas Tuchel is the England manager. He says the team is doing well without Cole Palmer. England played well in the Nations League camp. Palmer was not there. The Evening Standard shared this.", "Cheikhou Kouyate is a former Premier League player. He recently retired. He said he had a heart problem for many years. He kept it a secret during his career. The Daily Mirror reported this.", "In Formula 1, Rwanda may host a race soon. Rwanda looks set to beat South Africa. F1 is close to returning to Africa. The Independent wrote about this."], "paragraphs_zh": ["米克尔·阿尔特塔是阿森纳的主教练。他签下了一份新合同。新合同每年付给他2000万英镑。现在他是英超收入最高的主教练。这个消息来自《每日邮报》。", "利物浦也有新闻。他们正在考虑签下另一名大牌球员。他们想增强强大的攻击线。这个故事来自《每日星报》。", "其他消息，基兰·麦肯纳有了新工作。他现在为欧足联工作，担任技术观察员。这距离他离开伊普斯维奇才几个月。《太阳报》报道了这件事。", "托马斯·图赫尔是英格兰队主教练。他说球队在没有科尔·帕尔默的情况下表现很好。英格兰在欧国联训练营中踢得不错。帕尔默没有去。《标准晚报》分享了这条消息。", "谢库·库亚特是前英超球员。他最近退役了。他说自己多年来有心脏问题。他在职业生涯中一直保密。《每日镜报》报道了这件事。", "在F1中，卢旺达可能很快举办比赛。卢旺达看起来会击败南非。F1即将重返非洲。《独立报》写了这件事。"], "body": "Mikel Arteta is the manager of Arsenal. He has signed a new contract. The new deal pays him £20 million a year. Now he is the highest-paid boss in the Premier League. This news comes from the Daily Mail.\n\nLiverpool are also making news. They are thinking about signing another big player. They want to add to their strong attack. This story is from the Daily Star.\n\nIn other news, Kieran McKenna has a new job. He now works for UEFA as a technical observer. This is just months after he left Ipswich. The Sun reported this.\n\nThomas Tuchel is the England manager. He says the team is doing well without Cole Palmer. England played well in the Nations League camp. Palmer was not there. The Evening Standard shared this.\n\nCheikhou Kouyate is a former Premier League player. He recently retired. He said he had a heart problem for many years. He kept it a secret during his career. The Daily Mirror reported this.\n\nIn Formula 1, Rwanda may host a race soon. Rwanda looks set to beat South Africa. F1 is close to returning to Africa. The Independent wrote about this.", "body_zh": "米克尔·阿尔特塔是阿森纳的主教练。他签下了一份新合同。新合同每年付给他2000万英镑。现在他是英超收入最高的主教练。这个消息来自《每日邮报》。\n\n利物浦也有新闻。他们正在考虑签下另一名大牌球员。他们想增强强大的攻击线。这个故事来自《每日星报》。\n\n其他消息，基兰·麦肯纳有了新工作。他现在为欧足联工作，担任技术观察员。这距离他离开伊普斯维奇才几个月。《太阳报》报道了这件事。\n\n托马斯·图赫尔是英格兰队主教练。他说球队在没有科尔·帕尔默的情况下表现很好。英格兰在欧国联训练营中踢得不错。帕尔默没有去。《标准晚报》分享了这条消息。\n\n谢库·库亚特是前英超球员。他最近退役了。他说自己多年来有心脏问题。他在职业生涯中一直保密。《每日镜报》报道了这件事。\n\n在F1中，卢旺达可能很快举办比赛。卢旺达看起来会击败南非。F1即将重返非洲。《独立报》写了这件事。", "text": "Mikel Arteta is the manager of Arsenal. He has signed a new contract. The new deal pays him £20 million a year. Now he is the highest-paid boss in the Premier League. This news comes from the Daily Mail. Liverpool are also making news. They are thinking about signing another big player. They want to add to their strong attack. This story is from the Daily Star. In other news, Kieran McKenna has a new job. He now works for UEFA as a technical observer. This is just months after he left Ipswich. The Sun reported this. Thomas Tuchel is the England manager. He says the team is doing well without Cole Palmer. England played well in the Nations League camp. Palmer was not there. The Evening Standard shared this. Cheikhou Kouyate is a former Premier League player. He recently retired. He said he had a heart problem for many years. He kept it a secret during his career. The Daily Mirror reported this. In Formula 1, Rwanda may host a race soon. Rwanda looks set to beat South Africa. F1 is close to returning to Africa. The Independent wrote about this.", "vocab": [{"word": "manager", "pos": "noun", "zh": "主教练", "note": "在足球中，manager 负责球队训练和比赛。"}, {"word": "contract", "pos": "noun", "zh": "合同", "note": "签合同可以说 sign a contract。"}, {"word": "highest-paid", "pos": "adj", "zh": "收入最高的", "note": "由最高级 highest 和 paid 组成。"}, {"word": "sign", "pos": "verb", "zh": "签（合同）；签约", "note": "常用搭配：sign a contract, sign a player。"}, {"word": "retire", "pos": "verb", "zh": "退役；退休", "note": "名词是 retirement。"}, {"word": "secret", "pos": "noun", "zh": "秘密", "note": "keep a secret 表示保守秘密。"}, {"word": "host", "pos": "verb", "zh": "主办；举办", "note": "host a race 举办比赛。"}, {"word": "observer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "观察员", "note": "technical observer 技术观察员。"}], "title_original": "Papers: Arteta becomes Premier League's highest-paid boss on £20m-a-year", "summary_original": "The top stories and transfer rumours from Wednesday's newspapers...", "body_original": "Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta becomes Premier League's highest-paid boss on £20m-a-year new contract - Paper Talk\nPlus: Liverpool weigh up another blockbuster signing to add to their mega money attacking line-up; Thomas Tuchel says the \"train is rolling\" without Cole Palmer after England impressed in his absence during the Nations League camp; Kieran McKenna lands UEFA job months after leaving Ipswich\nWednesday 7 October 2026 23:07, UK\nThe top stories and transfer rumours from Wednesday's newspapers...\nPREMIER LEAGUE\nMikel Arteta has become the Premier League's highest-paid boss on a £20m-a-year new contract -\nDaily Mail\nLiverpool are weighing up another blockbuster signing to add to their mega money attacking line-up -\nDaily Star\nTransfer Centre LIVE!\n|\nLatest on YOUR PL club!\nGot Sky?\nWatch LIVE football on your phone\n📱\nNot got Sky?\nGet Sky Sports\nor\nstream with no contract on NOW\nThe agent of Gianluigi Donnarumma, Enzo Raiola, has revealed Manchester City have provided his client with reassurances after the club's recent guilty verdict -\nDaily Mirror\nKieran McKenna has landed a new job working as a technical observer for UEFA just months after leaving Ipswich -\nThe Sun\nEx-Premier League star Cheikhou Kouyate has revealed that he spent years battling a heart condition. Kouyate, who recently announced his retirement, kept the problem a secret throughout his playing career -\nDaily Mirror\nENGLAND\nThomas Tuchel says the \"train is rolling\" without Cole Palmer after En